  "description": "Mama, just killed a man...\n\nAfter killing someone in a drunk driving accident, crooked detective Gun-Soo Ko hides the body inside her mother’s casket. But when a mysterious caller claims knowledge of the murder and demands the body back, Gun-Soo finds herself embroiled in a corruption scandal far worse than she ever imagined. \n\n(Source: Manta)",
